1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,992
My shadow walked away from me last Tuesday, leaving my feet completely naked on the cold concrete sidewalk.

2
00:00:08,292 --> 00:00:13,548
I did not scream. I just smiled because for the first time in my life, I wasn't alone.

3
00:00:13,848 --> 00:00:20,064
It stood by my locker, nodding at my jokes and filling the empty space where my friends should be.

4
00:00:20,364 --> 00:00:28,164
People finally noticed me. They whispered in the corridors, staring at the double silhouette walking beside my frame.

5
00:00:28,464 --> 00:00:35,880
Then came the soccer match. I tripped hard over the turf, expecting the usual agonizing crack in my ankle.

6
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:45,996
Instead, I felt nothing. Absolutely nothing. My shadow writhed on the grass, absorbing a violent snap that belonged to me.

7
00:00:46,296 --> 00:00:53,856
That was the bargain. It took my shape so it could take my suffering, keeping my fragile body completely safe.

8
00:00:54,156 --> 00:01:01,620
Tonight, the shadow stopped mimicking me. It stood up straight, shook its head, and turned toward the open road.

9
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:09,000
As it crossed the street into the dark, every broken bone it ever saved for me instantly returned.

10
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:14,868
Now my shadow is gone, and I am finally feeling everything it carried for me.
